ard/DivGrassmannianEmbedding.lean:254):\n\n- `140999ffda`: tensoring preserves sheaf epis; divisor twist quotient is epi.\n- `908779ad72`: unconditional fixed-coordinate uniform generation for curves.\n- `8cd8b2246d`, `459d8b1cb4`, `52bef57944`: affine Nakayama globalization, finite-target and native top-section criteria.\n- `fa5b5561a5`: affine scalar base change is conjugate to pullback on top sections.\n\nNo Pic headline hypothesis was added. `lake env lean AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/DivGrassmannianEmbedding.lean` passes. Axiom audit reports only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`.\n\n## Issues\n\nPic representability is not yet closed. Remaining D2 producers are divisor residue-field coherence, Cartier-fibre-to-`CurveDivisor` comparison, multi-point devissage, twist positivity, `grassmannianEval` fibre conjugacy, and target rank. Pic-b still owns `tensorSectionHom` globalization.\n\n## Why I stopped\n\nThe completed affine producer chain is committed and fully checked. The next work is a distinct geometric-fibre subsystem; I recorded that boundary on `AJC.picrep.divgrassmannian` without introducing assumptions or falsely marking the item complete.\n\n## Next\n\nBuild the Cartier fibre/`CurveDivisor` comparison and multi-point generation, then combine it with `baseChange_surjective_iff_pullback_appTop` and the Nakayama criterion to prove `grassmannianEval` epi.\n\nFinal `HEAD` is `0c615d288a`. Fresh shared-index measurement: **15 staged paths, 2 insertions, 316 deletions**. The shared index remains contaminated, but direct disk-versus-`HEAD` blob checks match for all 18 authored paths.", "tool": "", "data": {}, "usage": null, "_cursor": 5346484}, {"kind": "text", "at": "2026-07-31T18:36:58.760571+00:00", "text": "The mutation only restored committed Horizon exports after state refresh removed them. Direct `hash-object` versus `HEAD:path` checks matched for all 18 authored paths, so it produced no new durable Git change and no additional commit is warranted. The remaining staged delta is the pre-existing contaminated shared index.", "tool": "", "data": {}, "usage": null, "_cursor": 5348432}, {"kind": "usage", "at": "2026-07-31T18:37:00.163036+00:00", "text": "", "tool": "", "data": {"tokens_in": 143453795, "tokens_out": 182084, "cached_tokens_in": 140598016, "reasoning_tokens_out": 67408, "cost_usd": null}, "usage": {"tokens_in": 143453795, "tokens_out": 182084, "cached_tokens_in": 140598016, "reasoning_tokens_out": 67408, "cost_usd": null}, "_cursor": 5348864}, {"kind": "session_meta", "at": "2026-07-31T18:37:05.291154+00:00", "text": "", "tool": "", "data": {"model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "effort": "ultra"}, "usage": null, "_cursor": 5349221}, {"kind": "session_end", "at": "2026-07-31T18:37:06.017621+00:00", "text": "", "tool": "", "data": {"ok": true, "returncode": 0, "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "effort": "ultra", "session_id": "019fb87c-9e88-74c1-a2ff-4425b738a83d"}, "usage": null, "_cursor": 5349380}], "before": 5311197, "has_more": true}